    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Blipper</i></strong> is a twinstick arcade shooter with a retro scifi vibe and an element of bullet hell. Destroy waves of neon enemies across multiple arenas while dodging attackers and incoming fire in your small ship. Dash for weapon powerups and extra lives if you dare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend through five different arenas, battling enemies of increasing danger and intensity. Will you reach enlightenment?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long will you survive against the clock in a single arena before you run out of lives? Not very long!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the blast waves of the regenerating crystals to obliterate your enemies - <i>BOOM!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Blipper</i></strong> can be played with a dual stick controller - one stick move, one stick shoot - or with keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Blipper</i></strong> contains an original soundtrack by the developer.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Blipper</i></strong> is a twinstick arcade shooter with a retro scifi vibe and an element of bullet hell. Destroy waves of neon enemies across multiple arenas while dodging attackers and incoming fire in your small ship. Dash for weapon powerups and extra lives if you dare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend through five different arenas, battling enemies of increasing danger and intensity. Will you reach enlightenment?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long will you survive against the clock in a single arena before you run out of lives? Not very long!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crystal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the blast waves of the regenerating crystals to obliterate your enemies - <i>BOOM!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Blipper</i></strong> can be played with a dual stick controller - one stick move, one stick shoot - or with keyboard and mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Blipper</i></strong> contains an original soundtrack by the developer.</p>",
